{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# 🏠 House Price Prediction — End-to-End Machine Learning Project\n","\n","**A beginner-friendly, step-by-step regression project**\n","\n","In this notebook we build a model that predicts a house's `SalePrice` from its\n","characteristics — size, quality, location, age, and so on (the classic Ames Housing\n","dataset).\n","\n","1. Load & explore the raw dataset\n","2. Clean the data (handle missing values properly)\n","3. Engineer a few useful new features\n","4. Encode categorical variables\n","5. Split into train/test sets\n","6. Train **multiple** regression models\n","7. Tune hyperparameters with **GridSearchCV**\n","8. Evaluate models with **K-Fold Cross-Validation**\n","9. Compare all models and pick the best one\n","10. Save the final model as a `.pkl` file\n","11. Reload the saved model and make a prediction, to prove it works\n"],"metadata":{"id":"ElS2LhZkTI9L"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"zB2LQ-0lZfVW"},"outputs":[],"source":["import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","import warnings\n","warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"AG99ccI9Zvt2"},"outputs":[],"source":["data = pd.read_excel(\"/content/house_data.csv.xlsx\")"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":256},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":15,"status":"ok","timestamp":1780556304333,"user":{"displayName":"Girish gowda M","userId":"00555909254441654473"},"user_tz":-330},"id":"8WhTBHCqaJOP","outputId":"d2c54138-c9bf-4395-b98c-b30f21a92b86"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["   Id  MSSubClass MSZoning  LotFrontage  LotArea Street Alley LotShape  \\\n","0   1          60       RL         65.0     8450   Pave   NaN      Reg   \n","1   2          20       RL         80.0     9600   Pave   NaN      Reg   \n","2